	// That is the same shape audit uses for actor IPs —
	// `system.audit.pii.read` on top of `system.audit.read`
	// (#425). Raw IPs are one data class with one bar, gated
	// `<area>.pii.read` additive to `<area>.read` (ADR 0072).
